              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "la scusa — \"the excuse; the apology\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Non cercare scuse: hai sbagliato tu. Do not look for excuses: you got it wrong."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Chiedere scusa — to apologise. Scusa! — sorry! (to a friend); scusi! to a stranger."
            }
          ]
        },
