              "text": "giustificare — \"to justify\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Niente può giustificare un comportamento così. Nothing can justify behaviour like that."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Giustificarsi — to justify yourself. At school, giustificare un ritardo — to give a reason for being late."
            }
